abstract: "Arabic-first PDF-to-DOCX runtime with isolated data, training, and model subsystems, aimed at open, self-hostable, independently evaluated Arabic Document AI infrastructure. It converts trusted born-digital PDF text into editable DOCX files for Arabic, English, and mixed-language documents while preserving page order, Arabic Unicode, RTL paragraph direction, and page boundaries, and routes scanned, image-only, or uncertain pages to explicit review states instead of unmeasured OCR output. The repository also includes deterministic synthetic data generation, pre-training dataset preparation, training planning, and a published metadata-only Arabic OCR benchmark. No final trained OCR model is bundled and OCR inference remains disabled by default."
